; samanya: universal — what is common across many particulars.
; "mass" as a concept (not mass=5kg of this ball) is samanya.
; the kosha node IS samanya; the rashi instance IS vishesa.
; samanya and vishesa are pratipaksha — each defines the other.

(sangati samanya
  (amsha padartha)
  (pratipaksha vishesa)
  (sthita ananta)
  (siddha pratyaksha))
